e exact tag from that `Dockerfile-<slug>` instead of introducing a new one, since the allow-list permits a single shared tag per image.\nPut environment variables, system properties, and other test-code setup in `agent_guidance`. Do not restate deterministic entries as guidance.\n\nReturn a single JSON object with this shape:\n{\n  \"action\": \"no_action\" | \"advisory_preparation\",\n  \"summary\": \"short reason\",\n  \"deterministic_setup\": [ ... dependency or docker_image entries, if any ... ],\n  \"agent_guidance\": \"environment/system property/test setup guidance, if any\",\n  \"risks\": [\"risk notes, if any\"]\n}\n\nChoose no_action unless your research finds concrete evidence that extra setup is needed.\n\nContext (starting point):\n{\n  \"issue\": {\n    \"number\": 8928,\n    \"title\": \"Update existing library: org.eclipse.jetty:jetty-util:12.0.9\",\n    \"label\": \"library-update-request\",\n    \"body\": \"Dynamic-access coverage for this version is low (7%, 4/55 call sites). The metadata and tests should be updated so the remaining dynamic-access call sites are exercised.\",\n    \"body_error\": \"\"\n  },\n  \"library\": \"org.eclipse.jetty:jetty-util:12.0.9\",\n  \"current_library\": null,\n  \"new_version\": null,\n  \"existing_tests\": {\n    \"org.eclipse.jetty:jetty-util:12.0.9\": [\n      \"tests/src/org.eclipse.jetty/jetty-util/12.0.9/.gitignore\",\n      \"tests/src/org.eclipse.jetty/jetty-util/12.0.9/build.gradle\",\n      \"tests/src/org.eclipse.jetty/jetty-util/12.0.9/gradle.properties\",\n      \"tests/src/org.eclipse.jetty/jetty-util/12.0.9/settings.gradle\",\n      \"tests/src/org.eclipse.jetty/jetty-util/12.0.9/src/test/java/org_eclipse_jetty/jetty_util/Jetty_utilTest.java\"\n    ]\n  }\n}/home/mihailo/git/graalvm-reachability-metadata-copy/forge/local_repositories/preflight_info/8928-cc62f43f/.library_update_route.json\t111 bytes\n--- /home/mihailo/git/graalvm-reachability-metadata-copy/forge/local_repositories/preflight_info/892